  "name": "Example: Translating Statements Involving Nested Quantifiers",
  "problem": "Express the following statement in words.\n\n$\\qquad$ $\\forall \\, x \\in \\mathbb{R}^+,\\,\\exists \\, a \\in \\mathbb{R},\\, a^2 =x.$",
  "worked_solution": "Our quantified statement reads as follows:\n\n$\\qquad$ **For all** $x \\in \\mathbb{R}^+,$ **there exists** $a \\in \\mathbb{R}$ **such that** $a^2=x.$\n\nThis can be re-phrased as follows:\n\n$\\qquad$ For every positive real number $x$ there is a real number $a$ such that $a^2=x.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
